/-!
# The table evaluations' templates (G:2594-2605)

`vtEvalData[k]`: evaluation `k`'s first statement and its value; it is `fs_next` at the cursor
`σ 2652` (offset `k`, the words `col_eval_words` names), copied into `col_evals`. `vtPermData[j]`: the permutation before evaluation `4(j + 1)`, its first statement
and its outputs' first value. Generated by `scripts/b1c-vt/genevals.py`.
-/

